# Kaboo — secret NAMES only. Never commit values.
#
# One secret, required:
#
#   ROOM_SECRET   HMAC key that signs every player's session token.
#                 Production:  wrangler secret put ROOM_SECRET   (e.g. openssl rand -hex 32)
#                 Local dev:   `bun run dev` writes a random one into .dev.vars
#
# Nothing else. Room state lives in Durable Objects and push travels over the
# room's own WebSockets, so there is no database URL and no realtime API key.
ROOM_SECRET=
